{"id":"c301d5689e0f6bf7","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-hash-isolation.md","title":"两两独立散列的唯一隔离界","display":"thm-hash-isolation — 两两独立散列的唯一隔离界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-hash-isolation","aliases":["28-thm-hash-isolation"],"display":"thm-hash-isolation — 两两独立散列的唯一隔离界","depends_on":["[[28-df-pairwise-independent-family]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; 354","source_printed_pages":"354","source_pdf_pages":"380","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":true,"proof_status":"source-proof-and-local-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-hash-isolation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-hash-isolation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hash-isolation — 两两独立散列的唯一隔离界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d828bbffc0f86990\" href=\"?note=d828bbffc0f86990\" title=\"28-df-pairwise-independent-family\">28-df-pairwise-independent-family</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; 354"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"354"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"380"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-local-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(D=\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\{0,1\\}^k\">\\(R=\\{0,1\\}^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq R^D\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq R^D\\)</span> 有限，满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d828bbffc0f86990\" href=\"?note=d828bbffc0f86990\" title=\"28-df-pairwise-independent-family\">28-df-pairwise-independent-family</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;D,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;D,R)\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq D\">\\(S\\subseteq D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{k-2}\\le|S|\\le2^{k-1}\">\\(2^{k-2}\\le|S|\\le2^{k-1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\">\\(\\mathcal H\\)</span> 上均匀抽取。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_h=|\\{x\\in S:h(x)=0^k\\}|\">\\(N_h=|\\{x\\in S:h(x)=0^k\\}|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu=|S|2^{-k}\">\\(\\mu=|S|2^{-k}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr_{h\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}}[N_h=1]\\ge\\mu-\\mu^2\\ge\\frac18.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr_{h\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}}[N_h=1]\\ge\\mu-\\mu^2\\ge\\frac18.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>令<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_x=\\mathbf1[h(x)=0^k]\">\\(I_x=\\mathbf1[h(x)=0^k]\\)</span>。两两独立给出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb EI_x=2^{-k}\">\\(\\mathbb EI_x=2^{-k}\\)</span>及<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E(I_xI_y)=2^{-2k}\">\\(\\mathbb E(I_xI_y)=2^{-2k}\\)</span>（x≠y）。对任意非负整数N有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1[N=1]\\ge N-N(N-1)\">\\(\\mathbf1[N=1]\\ge N-N(N-1)\\)</span>：N=0、1、2时直接成立，N≥3时右侧为负。取期望得<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[N_h=1]\\ge|S|2^{-k}-|S|(|S|-1)2^{-2k}\\ge\\mu-\\mu^2\">\\(\\Pr[N_h=1]\\ge|S|2^{-k}-|S|(|S|-1)2^{-2k}\\ge\\mu-\\mu^2\\)</span>。由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\\in[1/4,1/2]\">\\(\\mu\\in[1/4,1/2]\\)</span>得末项至少3/16，故原书较宽松的1/8界成立。空集合被规模假设排除；单点域仍需边缘均匀条件，已由现有PairInd接口保证。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma17.19及证明，印刷354 / PDF380。已逐式核对原书使用两两独立、并合界及二阶包含排除的证明；本条给出等价的整数指示函数论证。此节点是概率引理，不把唯一解语言USAT误写成一般NP完全问题，也没有代替整个Valiant–Vazirani归约的构造证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-pairwise-independent-family","status":"resolved","id":"d828bbffc0f86990","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pairwise-independent-family]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pairwise-independent-family","status":"resolved","id":"d828bbffc0f86990","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$D=\\{0,1\\}^n$，$R=\\{0,1\\}^k$，$\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq R^D$ 有限，满足 [[28-df-pairwise-independent-family]] 的 $\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;D,R)$。\n$S\\subseteq D$，$2^{k-2}\\le|S|\\le2^{k-1}$；$h$ 在 $\\mathcal H$ 上均匀抽取。$N_h=|\\{x\\in S:h(x)=0^k\\}|$，$\\mu=|S|2^{-k}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"R=\\{0,1\\}^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq R^D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;D,R)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq D","display":false},{"tex":"2^{k-2}\\le|S|\\le2^{k-1}","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H","display":false},{"tex":"N_h=|\\{x\\in S:h(x)=0^k\\}|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu=|S|2^{-k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr_{h\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}}[N_h=1]\\ge\\mu-\\mu^2\\ge\\frac18.","display":true},{"tex":"I_x=\\mathbf1[h(x)=0^k]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb EI_x=2^{-k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb E(I_xI_y)=2^{-2k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1[N=1]\\ge N-N(N-1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr[N_h=1]\\ge|S|2^{-k}-|S|(|S|-1)2^{-2k}\\ge\\mu-\\mu^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu\\in[1/4,1/2]","display":false}],"bytes":1893,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-238","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"计数复杂性与隔离引理：[[28-df-sharp-sat]]、[[28-df-counting-reduction]]、[[28-thm-sharp-sat-complete]]、[[28-thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat]]、[[28-thm-hash-isolation]]。"}],"outgoing":["d828bbffc0f86990"]}